(3414217, 473972, 70369, '<td valign="top">to me, a shadow or silhouette is not representing low key lighting. You do have a lot of brightness in the photo &amp; by itself is very powerfull, just maybe not for this challenge.</td>', 'to me, a shadow or silhouette is not representing low key lighting. You do have a lot of brightness in the photo & by itself is very powerfull, just maybe not for this challenge.', '2007-02-28 14:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
