(3415658, 474275, 20330, '<td valign="top">While shooting for this challenge I had a similar look on a photo I took, where a part of the face was sticking out of the blackness.. I wish I could have edited it out but couldn''t, so I decided on another shot. This is great, but imo I think it would look way better with the right side of the face burnt out to black and there only be half a face.. cute kid and great shot :)</td>', 'While shooting for this challenge I had a similar look on a photo I took, where a part of the face was sticking out of the blackness.. I wish I could have edited it out but couldn''t, so I decided on another shot. This is great, but imo I think it would look way better with the right side of the face burnt out to black and there only be half a face.. cute kid and great shot :)', '2007-02-28 22:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3415672, 473640, 20330, '<td valign="top">imho, this has way to much contrast, its too black. I think that might be because you didnt shoot in low light but rather tried to take an image and make it darker? I love the shot, would like to see the original :)</td>', 'imho, this has way to much contrast, its too black. I think that might be because you didnt shoot in low light but rather tried to take an image and make it darker? I love the shot, would like to see the original :)', '2007-02-28 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
