(3435675, 474947, 45194, '<td valign="top">What a shame this didn''t finish higher.  I think this image smokes and meets the challenge dead on.  I didn''t vote on the entire challenge but when I saw your photo I thought it was the best in the first 23% I''d voted on.  Great job.</td>', 'What a shame this didn''t finish higher.  I think this image smokes and meets the challenge dead on.  I didn''t vote on the entire challenge but when I saw your photo I thought it was the best in the first 23% I''d voted on.  Great job.', '2007-03-07 00:23:35.000000', NULL, 0),
