(3435686, 476794, 67697, '<td valign="top">I obviously do not know much about low key shooting but I like the use of black and white here.  I did not get to vote on this during the challenge, but the only thing that I cannot put together is the abacus and the wording on the box?  i would have forgone the box and tried a black background to absorb the shadow from the light.  Personally, I think your lighting here is excellent!</td>', 'I obviously do not know much about low key shooting but I like the use of black and white here.  I did not get to vote on this during the challenge, but the only thing that I cannot put together is the abacus and the wording on the box?  i would have forgone the box and tried a black background to absorb the shadow from the light.  Personally, I think your lighting here is excellent!', '2007-03-07 00:24:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3435688, 474272, 68504, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautifully done.', '2007-03-07 00:24:52.000000', NULL, 0),
