(3435706, 476650, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites from the challenge, Catherine - you did a fine job!  The petals, in my opinion, are perfectly lit for this, and yes, I do like that little lit bit on the stem.  I''m actually surprised this didn''t score higher than it did.  Good choice for the background, and I do like being able to see some of the texture.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites from the challenge, Catherine - you did a fine job!  The petals, in my opinion, are perfectly lit for this, and yes, I do like that little lit bit on the stem.  I''m actually surprised this didn''t score higher than it did.  Good choice for the background, and I do like being able to see some of the texture.', '2007-03-07 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3435713, 475641, 45475, '<td valign="top">OMG Hanae! I love this shot! I thought it was a perfect example of a low key portrait. I must be the only person who has never seen "The Professional" lol, but I loved the use of the glasses here. They add so much and I guess that was the whole idea. Well done, another top scoring image from you, congrats!!</td>', 'OMG Hanae! I love this shot! I thought it was a perfect example of a low key portrait. I must be the only person who has never seen "The Professional" lol, but I loved the use of the glasses here. They add so much and I guess that was the whole idea. Well done, another top scoring image from you, congrats!!', '2007-03-07 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3435714, 475572, 57981, '<td valign="top">brilliant work mak ... you''re in good form lately!!<br/> <br/>this is a great shot and an interesting composition. well done!<br/> <br/>gimme a ''D''!!! :)</td>', 'brilliant work mak ... you''re in good form lately!! this is a great shot and an interesting composition. well done! gimme a ''D''!!! :)', '2007-03-07 00:29:24.000000', NULL, 0),
