(3435748, 476822, 61818, '<td valign="top">Looks low key to me.  White balance is goofed up (never saw a bmw logo with pink in it) and the composition is very poor.  Think rule of thirds.  Shot of a steering wheel is unlikely to win you any ribbons on dpc unless there is a steering wheel challenge some day.  Good luck.</td>', 'Looks low key to me.  White balance is goofed up (never saw a bmw logo with pink in it) and the composition is very poor.  Think rule of thirds.  Shot of a steering wheel is unlikely to win you any ribbons on dpc unless there is a steering wheel challenge some day.  Good luck.', '2007-03-07 00:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3435773, 475457, 60899, '<td valign="top">Should have done better....loved the image</td>', 'Should have done better....loved the image', '2007-03-07 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
