(3436090, 476822, 54292, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by routerguy666:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks low key to me.  White balance is goofed up (never saw a bmw logo with pink in it) and the composition is very poor.  Think rule of thirds.  Shot of a steering wheel is unlikely to win you any ribbons on dpc unless there is a steering wheel challenge some day.  Good luck. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe you should get your monitor calibrated. Looks like the reflections from the red interior may have a hand in this.<br/>Oh yeah! I gave this a 7 and the colours look fine to me. No colour cast.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-07 02:21:41.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by routerguy666: Looks low key to me.  White balance is goofed up (never saw a bmw logo with pink in it) and the composition is very poor.  Think rule of thirds.  Shot of a steering wheel is unlikely to win you any ribbons on dpc unless there is a steering wheel challenge some day.  Good luck.   Maybe you should get your monitor calibrated. Looks like the reflections from the red interior may have a hand in this.Oh yeah! I gave this a 7 and the colours look fine to me. No colour cast.', '2007-03-07 02:21:00.000000', '2007-03-07 02:21:41.000000', 0),
(3436107, 475572, 3746, '<td valign="top">Someone is on a roll... well done!!</td>', 'Someone is on a roll... well done!!', '2007-03-07 02:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
