(3437166, 476650, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo! I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given this a 10. The light is wonderful, and the detail in the shadows is captivating!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo! I didn''t vote in this challenge but would have given this a 10. The light is wonderful, and the detail in the shadows is captivating!', '2007-03-07 09:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3437167, 474849, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely composition, Deb, and the lighting is wonderful. I don''t completely understand low key, but with the dark background, and heavy shadow on the left, it seems low key to me. I think the colors are excellent, and I really like this still life.</td>', 'This is a lovely composition, Deb, and the lighting is wonderful. I don''t completely understand low key, but with the dark background, and heavy shadow on the left, it seems low key to me. I think the colors are excellent, and I really like this still life.', '2007-03-07 09:26:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3437173, 475919, 11854, '<td valign="top">Very "old fashioned" looking. I really like it alot. It has a lot of warmth and for lack of a better word, flavor to it.</td>', 'Very "old fashioned" looking. I really like it alot. It has a lot of warmth and for lack of a better word, flavor to it.', '2007-03-07 09:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3437181, 476091, 11854, '<td valign="top">This is very cute, but, that one bright catchlight in all the softness and darkness really throws you. I think if you could have gotten a little more light onto both eyes it would have done much better.</td>', 'This is very cute, but, that one bright catchlight in all the softness and darkness really throws you. I think if you could have gotten a little more light onto both eyes it would have done much better.', '2007-03-07 09:30:28.000000', NULL, 0),
