(3437676, 475842, 68573, '<td valign="top">I think your image your image suffered only because the typical votel thght loe key is all about black and white. What a loss- i see ur image as an excellent piece of low key- it should have actually ribboned. Anyways there''s life beyong DPC !!</td>', 'I think your image your image suffered only because the typical votel thght loe key is all about black and white. What a loss- i see ur image as an excellent piece of low key- it should have actually ribboned. Anyways there''s life beyong DPC !!', '2007-03-07 11:06:27.000000', NULL, 0),
