(3438308, 474632, 30982, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 and thought it not only met the challenge well but was a darn nice shot as well.  And apparently I didn''t recognize your wife or I''m not tired of seeing her.  I liked the button.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 and thought it not only met the challenge well but was a darn nice shot as well.  And apparently I didn''t recognize your wife or I''m not tired of seeing her.  I liked the button.', '2007-03-07 13:15:55.000000', NULL, 0),
