(3438332, 475639, 46663, '<td valign="top">Leroy, I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I do like this picture for several reasons.  I think (in my own limited opinion) that this fits the challenge perfectly.  The shadows, smoke and ambiance that is cast, along with the title you chose fits so well.  I love the way you didn''t center the subject, and the smoke almost appears to come from the sculpture itself - which adds a whole new mood to it all.</td>', 'Leroy, I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I do like this picture for several reasons.  I think (in my own limited opinion) that this fits the challenge perfectly.  The shadows, smoke and ambiance that is cast, along with the title you chose fits so well.  I love the way you didn''t center the subject, and the smoke almost appears to come from the sculpture itself - which adds a whole new mood to it all.', '2007-03-07 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438333, 476091, 59029, '<td valign="top">cute kitty! would''ve liked to see more of the eyes though.  Druli (aka Octopussy) says hi.</td>', 'cute kitty! would''ve liked to see more of the eyes though.  Druli (aka Octopussy) says hi.', '2007-03-07 13:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438336, 475639, 40718, '<td valign="top">The Technicals: Focus, contrast and lighting are well done.  I do like the fog machine effect. (I need to get one)<br/> <br/>The feel: I wonder if you could have emphasized the contours and textures of the bear more with a B&amp;W conversion instead of color.<br/> <br/>The game: The reality is that photos of figurines or statues rarely do well.  Had you used a model with the same setup and same composition, I''m sure it would have scored at least a half point higher if not more.</td>', 'The Technicals: Focus, contrast and lighting are well done.  I do like the fog machine effect. (I need to get one) The feel: I wonder if you could have emphasized the contours and textures of the bear more with a B&W conversion instead of color. The game: The reality is that photos of figurines or statues rarely do well.  Had you used a model with the same setup and same composition, I''m sure it would have scored at least a half point higher if not more.', '2007-03-07 13:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438337, 476197, 56254, '<td valign="top">I think that this image suffers from the poor lighting and the fact that it''s mostly out of focus ... I also don''t think that it really fit the challenge very well ... there was nothing to really draw me into the image and want to explore it ... since I''m not really good at the ''low key'' thing (I didn''t enter this challenge) I really don''t know what you could have done to make this better ... hopefully DrAchoo will be able to hit on that ...</td>', 'I think that this image suffers from the poor lighting and the fact that it''s mostly out of focus ... I also don''t think that it really fit the challenge very well ... there was nothing to really draw me into the image and want to explore it ... since I''m not really good at the ''low key'' thing (I didn''t enter this challenge) I really don''t know what you could have done to make this better ... hopefully DrAchoo will be able to hit on that ...', '2007-03-07 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438338, 474849, 59029, '<td valign="top">Again I regret not having voted in this challenge.  Dang.  A definite 9 from me, Deb, great texture to the shot.</td>', 'Again I regret not having voted in this challenge.  Dang.  A definite 9 from me, Deb, great texture to the shot.', '2007-03-07 13:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
