(3438361, 473907, 46663, '<td valign="top">Lea, I didn''t vote in this challenge, and with the exception of whatever is showing on the bottom right hand corner, you framed this picture very well.  I would have scored this image very high - yet I can''t believe this is why it didn''t score higher than it did.  This should have scored so much higher in my opinion.  The mood and expression in the young boy''s face is precious - while at the same time so sad.  Great job!</td>', 'Lea, I didn''t vote in this challenge, and with the exception of whatever is showing on the bottom right hand corner, you framed this picture very well.  I would have scored this image very high - yet I can''t believe this is why it didn''t score higher than it did.  This should have scored so much higher in my opinion.  The mood and expression in the young boy''s face is precious - while at the same time so sad.  Great job!', '2007-03-07 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438362, 476008, 59029, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be Svetlana''s at first - very nice shot, makes me wonder what they''re doing.</td>', 'I thought this might be Svetlana''s at first - very nice shot, makes me wonder what they''re doing.', '2007-03-07 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438367, 476600, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for the challenge. The focus is good and the DOF is nice also. It just seems a tad busy. Maybe if the left arm was under the blanket. It just kind of pulls my eye down there being right in front. The Black and white is perfect. This just wouldn''t be the same in color. Good work.</td>', 'Nice shot for the challenge. The focus is good and the DOF is nice also. It just seems a tad busy. Maybe if the left arm was under the blanket. It just kind of pulls my eye down there being right in front. The Black and white is perfect. This just wouldn''t be the same in color. Good work.', '2007-03-07 13:27:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438369, 473907, 40718, '<td valign="top">5.6 gets only a brief comment...<br/> <br/>Nice use of negative space and has a good feel to it.  The biggest problem is the low key is accomplished by what appears to be greatly reduced contrast.  You will see the best Low Key shots actually had some true whites in the image.  Most successful ones also converted to B&amp;W.</td>', '5.6 gets only a brief comment... Nice use of negative space and has a good feel to it.  The biggest problem is the low key is accomplished by what appears to be greatly reduced contrast.  You will see the best Low Key shots actually had some true whites in the image.  Most successful ones also converted to B&W.', '2007-03-07 13:27:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438382, 473029, 23484, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really cool shot and should have scored much higher.  I think it meets the challenge well and I like the processing. But, what do I know.</td>', 'I think this is a really cool shot and should have scored much higher.  I think it meets the challenge well and I like the processing. But, what do I know.', '2007-03-07 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438385, 476197, 46663, '<td valign="top">Rich, I didn''t enter this challenge, and didn''t get to spend as much time as I wanted looking at the submissions.  You certainly get full marks for creating an image that presents an ''out-of-this-world'' effect.  My first reaction was ''UFO'' or ''jellyfish''  The haze that is created from the mist just adds to that effect as well.  For a low light submission I think you met the challenge - I think it just didn''t capture the voters attention or interest.  In my opinion, this certainly wasn''t a sub 4 picture.</td>', 'Rich, I didn''t enter this challenge, and didn''t get to spend as much time as I wanted looking at the submissions.  You certainly get full marks for creating an image that presents an ''out-of-this-world'' effect.  My first reaction was ''UFO'' or ''jellyfish''  The haze that is created from the mist just adds to that effect as well.  For a low light submission I think you met the challenge - I think it just didn''t capture the voters attention or interest.  In my opinion, this certainly wasn''t a sub 4 picture.', '2007-03-07 13:31:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438387, 473839, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like this. Rarely do I like shots that are out of focus but this one just seems to work.</td>', 'I like this. Rarely do I like shots that are out of focus but this one just seems to work.', '2007-03-07 13:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438398, 473811, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The colors are nice and it is a great abstract.</td>', 'Nice shot. The colors are nice and it is a great abstract.', '2007-03-07 13:33:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438416, 476505, 46663, '<td valign="top">Bianca, I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I have enjoyed going through them after-the-fact.  I think your idea was well laid out and the lighting is perfect.  I think you could have gone with a tighter crop and not so centered.  I think the noise in the background surrounding the mask is a little distracting, and so the tighter crop would have eliminated that.  All in all though, I am impressed and would have scored it in the 6-7 range, as it clearly met the ''low light'' challenge.</td>', 'Bianca, I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I have enjoyed going through them after-the-fact.  I think your idea was well laid out and the lighting is perfect.  I think you could have gone with a tighter crop and not so centered.  I think the noise in the background surrounding the mask is a little distracting, and so the tighter crop would have eliminated that.  All in all though, I am impressed and would have scored it in the 6-7 range, as it clearly met the ''low light'' challenge.', '2007-03-07 13:36:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438424, 474849, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice low key shot. I think this would have looked really nice on a darker table. Just my opinion which doesn''t mean much. Nice compositon and soft colors. Focus is perfect.</td>', 'Nice low key shot. I think this would have looked really nice on a darker table. Just my opinion which doesn''t mean much. Nice compositon and soft colors. Focus is perfect.', '2007-03-07 13:37:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438438, 476744, 23484, '<td valign="top">The SickPup shows his evil side. Might be just a bit bright but interesting shot and well layed out.</td>', 'The SickPup shows his evil side. Might be just a bit bright but interesting shot and well layed out.', '2007-03-07 13:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438455, 473907, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Nice soft focus and good use of negative space on the right. I don''t see the D50 listed yet.</td>', 'I like this shot. Nice soft focus and good use of negative space on the right. I don''t see the D50 listed yet.', '2007-03-07 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438469, 474952, 23484, '<td valign="top">A new an interesting concept. Very simple but gets the job done.</td>', 'A new an interesting concept. Very simple but gets the job done.', '2007-03-07 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438490, 475842, 26633, '<td valign="top">Totally underrated. I assume most people were looking for monochrome work :(</td>', 'Totally underrated. I assume most people were looking for monochrome work :(', '2007-03-07 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438504, 476593, 53278, '<td valign="top">great perspective, but i have 2 comments to make<br/> <br/>1) increase the contrast<br/>2) remove noise<br/> <br/>for 1, you can play with levels,curves, selective colors, channel mizer in monochrome mode lower the red channel to 70-60% increase the green to 30% and the blue somwhere between 10 and 20%<br/> <br/>2) for the noise i think contrast will limit it, and i recomend neat image, (i am not sure if you allready have it ) you can get the free version and try it , if you need tips on how to use it let me know</td>', 'great perspective, but i have 2 comments to make 1) increase the contrast2) remove noise for 1, you can play with levels,curves, selective colors, channel mizer in monochrome mode lower the red channel to 70-60% increase the green to 30% and the blue somwhere between 10 and 20% 2) for the noise i think contrast will limit it, and i recomend neat image, (i am not sure if you allready have it ) you can get the free version and try it , if you need tips on how to use it let me know', '2007-03-07 13:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
