(3438532, 476350, 26633, '<td valign="top">I can''t understand why this took such a hammering. Super composition, dynamic leading lines, plenty of mystery. I like it a lot.</td>', 'I can''t understand why this took such a hammering. Super composition, dynamic leading lines, plenty of mystery. I like it a lot.', '2007-03-07 13:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
