(3438588, 474849, 46663, '<td valign="top">Deb, I definately think this is a low key shot.  I think some of the voters think low key is black and white - which the majority of the top scorers submitted.  Not taking away from any of those excellent shots, I believe you equally captured a creat low key shot.  I see your rule of thirds in this too.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would have scored this very high - 9.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Deb, I definately think this is a low key shot.  I think some of the voters think low key is black and white - which the majority of the top scorers submitted.  Not taking away from any of those excellent shots, I believe you equally captured a creat low key shot.  I see your rule of thirds in this too.  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but would have scored this very high - 9.  Thanks for sharing.', '2007-03-07 13:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438592, 476625, 53278, '<td valign="top">it''s funny , you and neophyte have the same idea.<br/> <br/>anyway, great perspective, <br/> <br/>but this picture lacks focus, it''s a bit blury, at least that''s how i see it, and you need more contrast, the highlights should be brighter, and the blacks should be darker.</td>', 'it''s funny , you and neophyte have the same idea. anyway, great perspective,  but this picture lacks focus, it''s a bit blury, at least that''s how i see it, and you need more contrast, the highlights should be brighter, and the blacks should be darker.', '2007-03-07 13:58:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438607, 475919, 53278, '<td valign="top">i am not sure why this did not do better, it has a strong message, good composition , focus, etc...<br/> <br/>but i agree with noraneko maybe it was not low key enough , that''s why it got hammered by voters.<br/> <br/>good job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-07 14:01:18.</i></td>', 'i am not sure why this did not do better, it has a strong message, good composition , focus, etc... but i agree with noraneko maybe it was not low key enough , that''s why it got hammered by voters. good job.', '2007-03-07 14:00:32.000000', '2007-03-07 14:01:18.000000', 0),
(3438642, 476197, 40718, '<td valign="top">boy, 2 in a row where people aren''t between 4.5 and 5.5.  The reason I like to have it at 4.5 is honestly shots in the 3s are mainly beyond help. (that''s not to say your photography is beyond help, just this particular shot).<br/> <br/>Perfectly centered, very low contrast, and an abstract subject all contributed to the score.  That being said, I do think you were creative in the shot.  It really does look like a UFO.<br/> <br/></td>', 'boy, 2 in a row where people aren''t between 4.5 and 5.5.  The reason I like to have it at 4.5 is honestly shots in the 3s are mainly beyond help. (that''s not to say your photography is beyond help, just this particular shot). Perfectly centered, very low contrast, and an abstract subject all contributed to the score.  That being said, I do think you were creative in the shot.  It really does look like a UFO. ', '2007-03-07 14:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438656, 475919, 50641, '<td valign="top">Pretty! (but uh, manly too ;-)  I like its tonal balance and the embossing on the flask. Low key challenges are a pita, such dissension about what the term really means.  Hey, if this shot were in a regular challenge, you''d probably get ''too dark!'' comments.  Go figger. Pfft.  Anyway, be happy, it''s a lovely picture to add to your collection.</td>', 'Pretty! (but uh, manly too ;-)  I like its tonal balance and the embossing on the flask. Low key challenges are a pita, such dissension about what the term really means.  Hey, if this shot were in a regular challenge, you''d probably get ''too dark!'' comments.  Go figger. Pfft.  Anyway, be happy, it''s a lovely picture to add to your collection.', '2007-03-07 14:10:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438657, 473839, 34113, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice with the hint of detail and faraway expression.</td>', 'Really, really nice with the hint of detail and faraway expression.', '2007-03-07 14:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438662, 475639, 30982, '<td valign="top">Provides very good definition of the contours and detail.  The point that strikes me is the light in the eye - gives it an animated look - a presence, despite it being a statue.</td>', 'Provides very good definition of the contours and detail.  The point that strikes me is the light in the eye - gives it an animated look - a presence, despite it being a statue.', '2007-03-07 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438670, 476505, 40718, '<td valign="top">The technicals: focus and lighting are well done.  The composition is quite static with a perfectly centered subject.  The low key is actually well done IMO.<br/> <br/>The feel: What does the low key approach add to the picture?  I''m not quite sure.  It does give a little mystery to the mask, but it isn''t strong.<br/> <br/>The game: Pictures of figurines, statues, or general kitsch are voted lower as a whole on DPC.  I''m sure you ran into some of that.</td>', 'The technicals: focus and lighting are well done.  The composition is quite static with a perfectly centered subject.  The low key is actually well done IMO. The feel: What does the low key approach add to the picture?  I''m not quite sure.  It does give a little mystery to the mask, but it isn''t strong. The game: Pictures of figurines, statues, or general kitsch are voted lower as a whole on DPC.  I''m sure you ran into some of that.', '2007-03-07 14:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438674, 473907, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light to gently outline the contours of the face.  In my opinion, it could have been a little brighter though it probably would have lowered your score in this particular challenge.  I''m not a good judge of low key, it seems.</td>', 'Nice soft light to gently outline the contours of the face.  In my opinion, it could have been a little brighter though it probably would have lowered your score in this particular challenge.  I''m not a good judge of low key, it seems.', '2007-03-07 14:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438681, 476197, 30982, '<td valign="top">I see this a bit more as underexposed than low key, though the definition of low key does vary.  In this instance, it''s hard to tell exactly what I''m looking at, which isn''t always a bad thing, but I''d have liked a bit more definition and detail.  I thought it was a frisbee kinda thing.  It certainly does look like a UFO, though!</td>', 'I see this a bit more as underexposed than low key, though the definition of low key does vary.  In this instance, it''s hard to tell exactly what I''m looking at, which isn''t always a bad thing, but I''d have liked a bit more definition and detail.  I thought it was a frisbee kinda thing.  It certainly does look like a UFO, though!', '2007-03-07 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438689, 476505, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think you did very well with the concept - to me "low key" brings out the contours and shapes of something and you did that here.  To help your score in this environment, you might try a composition a little less centered, with a bit of negative space.</td>', 'I think you did very well with the concept - to me "low key" brings out the contours and shapes of something and you did that here.  To help your score in this environment, you might try a composition a little less centered, with a bit of negative space.', '2007-03-07 14:17:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3438838, 476742, 66310, '<td valign="top">powerful!</td>', 'powerful!', '2007-03-07 14:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
