(3438976, 472852, 69102, '<td valign="top">A severely underrated shot. Thought I would see this much, much higher in the vote tallies. Not sure why it didn''t connect with the voters. The crop might be a little too tight, and I would have liked to see just a bit more light around the inner eyes. But otherwise a very emotive image. Perhaps this wasn''t classically low key enough for the mainstream crowd.</td>', 'A severely underrated shot. Thought I would see this much, much higher in the vote tallies. Not sure why it didn''t connect with the voters. The crop might be a little too tight, and I would have liked to see just a bit more light around the inner eyes. But otherwise a very emotive image. Perhaps this wasn''t classically low key enough for the mainstream crowd.', '2007-03-07 15:29:34.000000', NULL, 0),
