(3439021, 473907, 56828, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but this is a very good photo.  Your lighting is perfect.  Completely darkening the profile closest to the camera and only lighting the far side of his face.  You have a great catchlight in his eye.  Had I voted you would have gotten a 7 from me.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but this is a very good photo.  Your lighting is perfect.  Completely darkening the profile closest to the camera and only lighting the far side of his face.  You have a great catchlight in his eye.  Had I voted you would have gotten a 7 from me.', '2007-03-07 15:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
