(3439052, 476783, 74214, '<td valign="top">I am glad to have contributed to the high score on this one =) Congrats!</td>', 'I am glad to have contributed to the high score on this one =) Congrats!', '2007-03-07 15:43:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3439082, 472852, 60614, '<td valign="top">Amazed you didn''t get any comments during voting.  This is a very good photo.  I love B/W images.  But for the low key challenge it was not low key enough.  The light needed to highlight the contours of the persons face and the rest left in shadow.  At least that is the way I understand low key.  You should be very proud of this shot.  I agree with shutterpuppy that the crop is a little bit too tight.</td>', 'Amazed you didn''t get any comments during voting.  This is a very good photo.  I love B/W images.  But for the low key challenge it was not low key enough.  The light needed to highlight the contours of the persons face and the rest left in shadow.  At least that is the way I understand low key.  You should be very proud of this shot.  I agree with shutterpuppy that the crop is a little bit too tight.', '2007-03-07 15:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3439174, 476783, 43774, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!!', '2007-03-07 16:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
