(3440083, 474849, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m just going to free flow this comment.  I like the shot.  It''s quaint and I like the texture on the thread.  No, it wasn''t "low key" enough although looking at a histogram it does qualify. I''m torn between trying this in B&amp;W and keeping the nice warm browns.  I think I''d keep it in color.  The biggest question is, "why low key?"  I''m not sure I have the answer other than to meet the challenge.  The texture provided from the side lighting is good, but you don''t need low key to accomplish that.</td>', 'I''m just going to free flow this comment.  I like the shot.  It''s quaint and I like the texture on the thread.  No, it wasn''t "low key" enough although looking at a histogram it does qualify. I''m torn between trying this in B&W and keeping the nice warm browns.  I think I''d keep it in color.  The biggest question is, "why low key?"  I''m not sure I have the answer other than to meet the challenge.  The texture provided from the side lighting is good, but you don''t need low key to accomplish that.', '2007-03-07 19:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
