(3444012, 473181, 71931, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by things_to_do:</b></div><hr/><i> perhaps a bit too much negative space at bottom left </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>True... was trying to convey the sense of "that''s the end" without being ''vertical'' about it.  Also wanted the ''A'' key to be the only complete white key shown.  But you still make a valid point, and I appreciate it.  The comment about ''potential'' echoes the above.  In looking over the other entries, there were more on this basic concept than I expected, and that probably didn''t help any of us, much as having two songs from the same movie being nominated for an Oscar almost guaranteeing that neither will win.<br/> <br/>Thanks to those who upped their votes, especially for getting the humour :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-08 17:16:08.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by things_to_do: perhaps a bit too much negative space at bottom left   True... was trying to convey the sense of "that''s the end" without being ''vertical'' about it.  Also wanted the ''A'' key to be the only complete white key shown.  But you still make a valid point, and I appreciate it.  The comment about ''potential'' echoes the above.  In looking over the other entries, there were more on this basic concept than I expected, and that probably didn''t help any of us, much as having two songs from the same movie being nominated for an Oscar almost guaranteeing that neither will win. Thanks to those who upped their votes, especially for getting the humour :-)', '2007-03-08 17:15:31.000000', '2007-03-08 17:16:08.000000', 0),
